# Only needed for a STANDALONE clone of this repo.
#
# Inside a FamCart checkout the importer reads FamCart's own .env (see
# src/config.ts), which already has both of these — there is nothing to set up.
#
# The service role key is required: the anon key cannot write product_catalog
# (RLS grants SELECT and nothing else), and import_catalog_products() is granted
# to service_role alone. Never put this key in a client bundle.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Optional. Open Food Facts wants clients to identify themselves; the default
# points at this repository rather than a person, since it is public and a
# checked-in address is a spam magnet. Set a real contact here if you are
# running a large import and want them to be able to reach you.
# OFF_USER_AGENT=FamCartCatalogImporter/0.1 (you@example.com)
